Why: v0.36.0 refused a retained-element AX text insert when key-window priming failed; keep the semantic insert available while refusing implicit targets, terminals, synthesized-key fallback and document key edits without keyboard permission.

Each regression has a focused unit test in this patch. No foreground action
is introduced; unknown target facts continue to fail closed.

